1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,950
Her letters brought him to LaPorte,

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:02,592
Indiana.

3
00:00:02,822 --> 00:00:04,023
He never came home.

4
00:00:04,253 --> 00:00:05,596
His brother came looking.

5
00:00:06,146 --> 00:00:08,945
Andrew Helgelien was a Norwegian farmer in

6
00:00:08,955 --> 00:00:09,859
South Dakota.

7
00:00:10,089 --> 00:00:12,400
Belle Gunness sent him about 80 letters.

8
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,780
They told him to change his money into

9
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:16,549
bills, and to keep it a secret.

10
00:00:17,199 --> 00:00:20,104
In January 1908, he came to her farm.

11
00:00:20,334 --> 00:00:22,624
His money was drawn from a LaPorte bank,

12
00:00:22,634 --> 00:00:23,462
and he was gone.

13
00:00:24,262 --> 00:00:26,040
His brother Asle wrote to Belle.

14
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:27,631
She said Andrew had left.

15
00:00:27,861 --> 00:00:29,270
Asle didn't believe her.

16
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:32,117
On April 28, her farmhouse burned.

17
00:00:32,347 --> 00:00:34,746
Days later, Asle came to LaPorte and went

18
00:00:34,756 --> 00:00:35,606
to the sheriff.

19
00:00:36,156 --> 00:00:38,567
He dug with the hired man and others where

20
00:00:38,577 --> 00:00:39,893
garbage had been buried.

21
00:00:40,123 --> 00:00:41,967
There, Asle found his brother.

22
00:00:42,197 --> 00:00:43,563
It was only the beginning.

23
00:00:44,413 --> 00:00:46,559
Comment your town for the next LaPorte

24
00:00:46,569 --> 00:00:47,316
After Dark.

